                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "2b664bcc-8e46-49d2-a645-23a456a2ea18",
                        "entry_id": "233ee810-f232-3b7c-8bc8-a1ed5a87d5be",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "attilas"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "747f816e-85cc-3077-9fca-57cb824c14cc",
                        "entry_id": "233ee810-f232-3b7c-8bc8-a1ed5a87d5be",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A short, fringed cape worn as part of traditional Hungarian costume."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "30d39220-a1fa-406c-9515-9ab9f4b3fb5c",
                                "sense_id": "747f816e-85cc-3077-9fca-57cb824c14cc",
                                "text": "In the Magyar costume, his heart beating more proudly under the national attila, he passed before the eyes of the peasants who had known him when a child, and had fought under his orders; and he spoke to them by name, recognizing many of his old companions in these poor people with cheeks tanned by the sun, and heads whitened by age."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "82ceaae1-80dc-4920-9705-5662a0bd674e",
                                "sense_id": "747f816e-85cc-3077-9fca-57cb824c14cc",
                                "text": "As I gazed at myself in the looking-glass, I found that I should be a handsome boy when I had put on my silver-buttoned attila."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "ec21147f-3b63-35db-891e-041add11489c",
                        "entry_id": "233ee810-f232-3b7c-8bc8-a1ed5a87d5be",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Any of the tropical flycatchers of the genus Attila."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "931ac55b-0834-4fa5-9cc0-ee0dcc4656ba",
                                "sense_id": "ec21147f-3b63-35db-891e-041add11489c",
                                "text": "In the scrubby woods that cover most of the Yucatan, suboscines such as the masked tityra, the bright-rumped attila, and the boat-billed flycatcher are all common."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
